<report>
<title>Incidence rate ratio (IRR) meta-analysis</title>
<br />
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><thfirst>Table (a, person-time exposed, b, person-time not exposed)</thfirst><thspan/><thspan/><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="inputs"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>a</in></td><td><inu>pt1</inu></td><td><in>b</in></td><td><inu>pt2</inu></td><td><in>lb</in></td></tr></block>
</table>
<br />
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>IRR</th><thfirst><ci><in>pc</in>% CI (exact)</ci></thfirst><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="ir"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><inu>irr</inu></td><td><ci><inu>lci</inu></ci></td><td><ci><inu>uci</inu></ci></td><td><in>lb</in></td></tr></block>
</table>
<br />
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized effect</th><th>Variance</th><thfirst>% Weights (fixed, random)</thfirst><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="ir"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><inu>yi</inu></td><td><inu>vi</inu></td><td><in>wt</in></td><td><in>dwt</in></td><td><in>lb</in></td></tr></block>
</table>

<p><u>Fixed effects (inverse variance)</u><br />
Pooled IRR = <inu>rmh</inu> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from</inu> to <inu>to</inu></ci>)<br />
Z (test IRR differs from 1) = <inu>z</inu>  <pval><inp>p_z</inp></pval></p>
<block name="poolok">

<p>Fixed effects (conditional maximum likelihood)<br />
Pooled rate ratio = <inu>eor</inu><br />
<ci>Exact Fisher <in>pc</in>% confidence interval = <inu>llf</inu> to <inu>ulf</inu></ci><br />
<pval>Exact Fisher one sided <inp>p1f</inp>, two sided <inp>p2f</inp></pval><br />
<ci>Exact mid-P <in>pc</in>% confidence interval = <inu>llm</inu> to <inu>ulm</inu></ci><br />
<pval>Exact mid-P one sided <inp>p1m</inp>, two sided <inp>p2m</inp></pval></p>
</block>

<p><u>Non-combinability of studies</u><br />
Cohran Q = <inu>qc</inu>  (df = <in>df</in>) <pval><inp>xp</inp></pval><br />
Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = <inu>tausq</inu><br />
I<sub>2</sub> (inconsistency) = <in>isq</in>% (<ci><in>pc1</in>% CI = <in>llisq</in>% to <in>ulisq</in>%</ci>) </p>

<p><u>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</u><br />
Pooled IRR = <inu>dsirr</inu> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>dsll</inu> to <inu>dsul</inu></ci>)<br />
Z (test IRR differs from 1) = <inu>dz</inu>  <pval><inp>dp</inp></pval></p>
<block name="egger">

<p><u>Bias indicators</u><br />
Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's <in>tau</in>  <pval><inp>p2</inp></pval><br />
Egger: bias = <in>a</in> (<ci><in>pc_egger</in>% CI = <in>cl</in> to <in>cu</in></ci>)  <pval><inp>p</inp></pval></p>
</block>
</report>
